The CFITSIO error-status text table in `src/status.rs` and the default
required-keyword comments used when writing FITS headers reproduce wording
from CFITSIO 4.7.0 (HEASARC / NASA GSFC). That wording is included here so
rfitsio can match CFITSIO's public `ffgerr` output and byte-identical
headers. CFITSIO's own license notice follows.

The `vendor/cfitsio` directory is a pinned copy of CFITSIO 4.7.0 used only
to build the test-only oracle. It is not compiled into the published crate.

